# The build context is not the repository.
#
# Everything here is either useless in an image or actively unwanted in one. The
# Dockerfile copies four directories by name, so this is defence in depth — a
# later `COPY . .` written in a hurry should not be able to ship the test suite,
# and the seeded credentials in its fixtures, into production.

tests/
scripts/
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage
.env
.env.*
*.log
requirements-dev.lock.txt
